WEBVTT

preparation-01
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:09.200
Sambani m'manja ndi kuvala zipangizo zodzitetezera.

preparation-02
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:19.200
Konzani Arclight. Sankhani kuwala kwamphamvu kwambiri. Kwezani zonyamulira magalasi zonse ziwiri mpaka pamwamba. Gwiritsani ntchito chipinda chabata cha kuwala kochepa.

preparation-03a
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:28.200
Yandikitsani bowo loyang'aniramo pafupi ndi diso lanu.

preparation-03b
00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:35.200
Musaunikire m'diso lanu, ndipo musagwire chipangizocho cham'mbali.

preparation-04a
00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:44.200
Mwana wobadwa kumene akulungidwe bwino ndi nsalu.

preparation-04b
00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:48.200
Pemphani kholo kuti ligwire khanda lokulirapo,

preparation-04c
00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:52.200
ndipo mwana amene amakhala bwinobwino akhoza kukhala yekha.

examination-01
00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:59.800
Yambani patali pafupifupi utali wa mkono.

examination-02
00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:11.400
Yendani pang'ono chammbali ndi chammbali. Yandikirani ngati mukufuna kuona bwino.

examination-03
00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:27.400
Mukakhala patali utali wa mkono, pemphani mwanayo kuti akuyang'aneni. Yezeni maso onse awiri nthawi imodzi. Maonekedwe amasiyanasiyana malinga ndi mtunda wanu ndi kumene mwanayo akuyang'ana.

examination-04
00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:39.400
Kuwala kobwerera kuchokera kumbuyo kwa maso awiri kukhale kofanana pa kuwala kwake ndi mtundu wake. Kusiyana kwa mtundu kapena mphamvu ya kuwala, kapena kusapezeka kwa kuwalako, ndi kwachilendo. Ana amenewa atumizidwe kuti akayesedwe.

examination-05a
00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:49.100
Mtundu wabwinobwino wa kuwala kobwerera umasiyana ndi mtundu wa retina. Ungakhale wachikasu wosakanikirana ndi woyera, wabuluu pang'ono, walalanje wofiira kapena walalanje wachikasu.

examination-05b
00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:54.350
Maonekedwe onsewa ndi abwinobwino kwa ana amenewa.

eyes-open-01
00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:09.400
Pemphani kholo kuti ligwire bwino mwana wobadwa kumene, atakulungidwa ndi nsalu, manja ali mkati.

eyes-open-02
00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:24.400
Ngati maso ali otseguka, yesani kuona kuwala kobwerera m'maso onse awiri nthawi imodzi popanda kukhudza khandalo.

eyes-closed-01
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:34.500
Ngati khandalo lagona, yesetsani kuti musalidzutse.

eyes-closed-02
00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:38.200
Lungani khandalo ndi nsalu, manja ali mkati.

eyes-closed-03
00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:50.400
Tsegulani ndi kuyeza diso limodzi pa nthawi mofatsa. Chitani modekha, mofatsa ndi moleza mtima.

possible-findings-02
00:02:55.200 --> 00:03:00.000
Ndi chizindikiro chabwino ngati mtundu ndi mphamvu ya kuwala zikufanana.

possible-findings-01
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:12.000
M'mwezi woyamba maso amatha kuyang'ana mbali zosiyana kwa kanthawi. Vutoli nthawi zambiri limatha pasanathe miyezi itatu. Ngati likupitirirabe mwana atakwanitsa miyezi itatu, mutumizeni kuti akayesedwe.

possible-findings-03
00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:27.000
Kusiyana kwa mtundu, kapena kuwala kobwerera kusowa pang'ono kapena konse, n'kwachilendo ndipo kumafunika kuyezedwanso.

unclear-findings-01
00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:40.350
Ngati zomwe mwaona sizikumveka bwino, tsatirani njira zitatu zotsatirazi.

unclear-findings-02
00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:50.350
Choyamba, yerekezerani kuwala kobwerera kwa khandalo ndi kwa kholo lake. Kuyenera kuoneka kofanana.

unclear-findings-03
00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:57.350
Chachiwiri, ngati simukutsimikizabe, pemphani mnzanu wa kuntchito kuti aonenso.

unclear-findings-04
00:03:57.350 --> 00:04:06.350
Chachitatu, ngati palibe mnzanu, pemphani chilolezo,

unclear-findings-05a
00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:14.350
Lumikizani Arclight ku kamera ya foni ndipo jambulani kuwala kobwererako.

unclear-findings-05b
00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:20.350
Tumizani vidiyoyi motetezeka kuti munthu wina aonenso.

after-examination-01
00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:28.300
Thokozani kholo. Fotokozani zomwe mwaona ndi zomwe zichitike pambuyo pake.

after-examination-02
00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:34.270
Sambaninso m'manja. Apa kuyeza kuwala kobwerera kuchokera kumbuyo kwa diso kwatha.
